olute-return EWMA to slower 6h/24h targets, with 1h/6h/24h relaxation. Preserve df=5 and zero drift.\n+- Result: pending; compare to auto:0:1:5 on both development windows.\n+- Verdict: pending; require the established paired gain gate.\n+- Lesson: pending.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nuv run agent/research.py --name reversion_screen --variants auto:0:1:5,revert:360:60,revert:360:360,revert:360:1440,revert:1440:60,revert:1440:360,revert:1440:1440 --workers 6 > agent/reversion_screen.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
