{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_145","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: agent/research.py\n@@\n     sampled = raw_log.iloc[::-max(1,increment//60)].iloc[::-1].diff()\n+    output['step_returns']=sampled.replace([np.inf,-np.inf],np.nan).dropna().to_numpy()\n+    differences=np.round(np.abs(np.diff(close.to_numpy())),max(0,10-int(np.floor(np.log10(output['last'])))))\n+    positive_differences=differences[differences>0]\n+    output['tick']=float(positive_differences.min()) if len(positive_differences) else 0.\n@@\n     parts = variant.split(\\\":\\\")\n+    atom_mode=parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n+    atom_parameter=float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n@@\n     if auxiliary_strength is not None:\n@@\n         parts=['auto','0','1','5']\n+    if atom_mode:\n+        cycle_strength=.75\n+        parts=['hybrid','1']\n@@\n     if correlation_parameter is not None:\n@@\n             shocks[:,step] = correlation*shocks[:,step-1] + orthogonal*shocks[:,step]\n+    if atom_mode=='symboot':\n+        absolute_returns=np.abs(feature['step_returns'])\n+        if len(absolute_returns) and absolute_returns.mean()>0:\n+            magnitudes=rng.choice(absolute_returns,size=((count+1)//2,steps))\n+            magnitudes=np.concatenate([magnitudes,magnitudes],axis=0)[:count]\n+            shocks=np.sign(shocks)*magnitudes/absolute_returns.mean()*np.sqrt(2/np.pi)*atom_parameter\n+    if atom_mode=='hurdle':\n+        probability=float(np.clip(np.mean(feature['step_returns']==0)*atom_parameter,0,.8))\n+        shocks *= (rng.random(shocks.shape)>=probability)/(1-probability)\n@@\n-        if 2 < degrees < 100:\n+        if 2 < degrees < 100 and atom_mode\"'!='\"'symboot':\n@@\n-    return feature[\\\"last\\\"] * np.exp(log_paths)\n+    paths=feature[\\\"last\\\"] * np.exp(log_paths)\n+    if atom_mode=='quantize' and 0<feature['tick']<feature['last']*.01:\n+        tick=feature['tick']*atom_parameter\n+        paths=np.maximum(tick,feature['last']+np.rint((paths-feature['last'])/tick)*tick)\n+        paths[:,0]=feature['last']\n+    return paths\n*** Update File: agent/journal.md\n@@\n ## Iteration 16 — learn from optional candle and activity features (preregistered)\n@@\n - Lesson: pending.\n+\n+## Iteration 17 — observed atoms and price discreteness (preregistered)\n+\n+- Hypothesis: a continuous diffusion misses the atom at zero in observed returns. The earlier empirical bootstrap subtracted its sample mean and normalized RMS, which both obscured this question.\n+- Change: test a symmetrized empirical step-return bootstrap normalized by mean absolute magnitude, a zero-inflated increment model using past valid zero-return frequency, and simulated-price quantization at the smallest reliable observed price increment. None treats NaN as zero or assumes a closed trading session. Keep the same neural scale and positive local volatility profile.\n+- Result: pending. A pre-field July-25 context has zero-return fractions (1m/5m) BTC 3.7%/0.2%, SOL 14.2%/6.4%, XAU 27.8%/11.3%, and SP500 12.2%/5.2%; these motivate a measured test, not a presumed gain.\n+- Verdict: retain only consistent official CRPS/reward improvements, with arbitrary path-count and positive-price contracts preserved.\n+- Lesson: pending.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nuv run agent/research.py --name discrete_screen --variants cycle:0.75,symboot:0.8,symboot:0.9,symboot:1,hurdle:0.5,hurdle:1,quantize:1 --workers 3 > agent/discrete_screen.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
