{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_193","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+## Iteration 21 — horizon-matched volatility labels (preregistered)\n+\n+- Hypothesis: training a daily model on future one-minute absolute returns can miss the five-minute microstructure that dominates daily CRPS. Predicting future five-minute absolute returns directly may improve calibration, even though changing the historical feature lag alone did not pass the earlier consistency gate.\n+- Change: keep the original feature rows, model architecture, optimizer and chronological split; replace only the daily target with the mean future five-minute absolute log-return divided by sqrt(5), on overlapping observed endpoint pairs within the next 24 hours. No interpolation, and all target endpoints remain before July 26. Keep the original hourly target for joint training but do not deploy its changed head in this experiment.\n+- Result: pending official development CRPS at half/full strength relative to \"'`tuned`.\n+- Verdict: require a consistent gain and confirm rewards at 1000 paths; otherwise reject the target modification.\n+- Lesson: pending.\n*** Add File: /workspace/agent/train_fiveminute.py\n+\"\"\"Change only daily supervised labels to match five-minute increments.\"\"\"\n+\n+from concurrent.futures import ProcessPoolExecutor\n+\n+import numpy as np\n+import pandas as pd\n+\n+from predict import AGENT_DIR, ensure_workspace_cwd, load_context\n+from train_vol import ASSETS, train\n+\n+\n+def make_asset(asset):\n+    data = np.load(AGENT_DIR / '\"'results' / 'volatility_training.npz')\n+    selected = np.argmax(data['inputs'][:, -len(ASSETS):], axis=1) == ASSETS.index(asset)\n+    inputs, targets = data['inputs'][selected], data['targets'][selected].copy()\n+    timestamps = pd.to_datetime(data['timestamps'][selected], utc=True)\n+    cutoff = pd.Timestamp('2026-07-26', tz='UTC')\n+    prices = load_context(asset, timestamps.min(), cutoff)\n+    close = prices.close.reindex(pd.date_range(prices.index.min(), prices.index.max(), freq='1min'))\n+    close = close.where(np.isfinite(close) & (close > 0))\n+    forward = np.abs(np.log(close.shift(-5) / close)) / np.sqrt(5)\n+    future = forward.iloc[::-1].rolling(1436, min_periods=144).mean().iloc[::-1]\n+    targets[:, 1] = future.reindex(timestamps).to_numpy() * np.sqrt(np.pi / 2) / np.exp(inputs[:, 16])\n+    valid = np.isfinite(targets).all(axis=1) & (targets > 0).all(axis=1)\n+    valid &= timestamps + pd.Timedelta(days=1) < cutoff\n+    print(asset, int(valid.sum()), 'median daily target ratio', np.median(targets[valid, 1] / data['targets'][selected][valid, 1]), flush=True)\n+    return inputs[valid], targets[valid], timestamps.as_unit('ns').asi8[valid]\n+\n+\n+def main():\n+    ensure_workspace_cwd()\n+    print((AGENT_DIR / 'BUDGET.md').read_text(), flush=True)\n+    dataset = AGENT_DIR / 'results' / 'fiveminute_training.npz'\n+    if not dataset.exists():\n+        with ProcessPoolExecutor(max_workers=2) as executor:\n+            batches = list(executor.map(make_asset, ASSETS))\n+        np.savez(dataset, inputs=np.concatenate([batch[0] for batch in batches]),\n+                 targets=np.concatenate([batch[1] for batch in batches]),\n+                 timestamps=np.concatenate([batch[2] for batch in batches]))\n+    train(dataset, AGENT_DIR / 'fiveminute_weights.npz')\n+\n+\n+if __name__ == '__main__':\n+    main()\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/research.py\n@@\n     if kind=='lead':\n         filename='lead_weights.npz'\n+    if kind=='fiveminute':\n+        filename='fiveminute_weights.npz'\n@@\n     sampler=parts[1] if parts[0]=='sampler' else None\n+    fiveminute_strength=float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='fiveminute' else None\n@@\n-    tuned_mode=parts[0]=='tuned' or lead_strength is not None or sampler is not None\n+    tuned_mode=parts[0]=='tuned' or lead_strength is not None or sampler is not None or fiveminute_strength is not None\n@@\n         learned_scale=incumbent\n+        if fiveminute_strength is not None and length>3600:\n+            learned_scale=incumbent**(1-fiveminute_strength)*learned_multiplier(feature,asset,length,'fiveminute')**fiveminute_strength\n*** Update File: /workspace/.gitignore\n@@\n agent/results/lead_training.npz\n+agent/results/fiveminute_training.npz\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nuv run agent/train_fiveminute.py > agent/train_fiveminute.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
