{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_228","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/modeling.py\n@@\n CYCLE_STRENGTH = 0.75\n+LEAD_STRENGTH = 0.5\n@@\n-@lru_cache(maxsize=1)\n-def _weights():\n-    with np.load(Path(__file__).with_name(\\\"volatility_weights.npz\\\"), allow_pickle=False) as archive:\n+@lru_cache(maxsize=2)\n+def _weights(kind='volatility'):\n+    with np.load(Path(__file__).with_name(f\\\"{kind}_weights.npz\\\"), allow_pickle=False) as archive:\n@@\n-def _learned_multiplier(absolute, root_square, asset, hourly):\n+def _feature_values(absolute, root_square, asset):\n@@\n-    weights = _weights()\n-    inputs = np.clip((np.asarray(values, dtype=np.float32) - weights[\\\"center\\\"]) / weights[\\\"spread\\\"], -8, 8)\n+    return np.asarray(values,dtype=np.float32)\n+\n+\n+def _network_output(values, weights):\n+    inputs = np.clip((values - weights[\\\"center\\\"]) / weights[\\\"spread\\\"], -8, 8)\n@@\n-    output = weights[\\\"4.weight\\\"] @ inputs + weights[\\\"4.bias\\\"]\n+    return weights[\\\"4.weight\\\"] @ inputs + weights[\\\"4.bias\\\"]\n+\n+\n+def _learned_multiplier(absolute, root_square, asset, hourly):\n+    output = _network_output(_feature_values(absolute,root_square,asset),_weights())\n@@\n     return float(np.exp(np.clip(output[0 if hourly else 1], -2, 2))) ** strength\n+\n+\n+def _lead_profile(absolute, root_square, asset, steps, increment):\n+    if steps == 0:\n+        return np.ones(0)\n+    weights = _weights('lead')\n+    buckets = np.exp(np.clip(_network_output(_feature_values(absolute,root_square,asset),weights),-2,2))\n+    centers = (weights['edges'][:-1]+weights['edges'][1:])/2\n+    shape = np.interp(np.arange(1,steps+1)*increment/60,centers,buckets)\n+    shape = np.clip(shape/shape.mean(),.4,2.5)**LEAD_STRENGTH\n+    return shape/shape.mean()\n@@\n         sigma *= 1 + CYCLE_STRENGTH*(profile[future_times.hour]-1)\n+        if timestamp >= WEIGHTS_AVAILABLE_FROM:\n+            sigma *= _lead_profile(absolute,root_square,asset,steps,time_increment)\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+### Full daily lead confirmation and promotion\n+\n+At 1000 paths and every official reward round, half lead shape improves daily crypto reward ratios 0.135626→0.151344 (rank 118→97) and 0.037376→0.058647 (rank 230→227), and COM_EQU 0.000498→0.000785 (rank unchanged at 174) and 0.000156→0.000442 (rank 231→230). There are 1,499/1,474 equity rounds and 1,015/1,044 daily-crypto rounds in dev1/dev2. Promote half lead shape with its pre-July-26 weights. Combined with the confirmed hourly correction, development Score estimates become 26.071 and 25.439. The remaining daily reward gap is still large, so continue the campaign.\n+\n+### Iteration 23 first result\n+\n+The fixed four-seed ensemble yields only tiny daily changes (full-strength COM_EQU 1.00026/0.99928, daily crypto 1.00005/0.99990), while hourly improves 0.99953/0.99982. Discard as a general daily replacement. Retain the hourly ensemble only for a dense reward screen against the temporal correction; no individual seed is cherry-picked.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0,'agent')\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom modeling import simulate\nfrom predict import load_context\nfrom research import features,generate_variant\nfor asset in ['BTC','SP500','GOOGLX']:\n    stamp=pd.Timestamp('2026-08-10 12:34:37',tz='UTC')\n    context=load_context(asset,stamp-pd.Timedelta(days=7),stamp)\n    for length,increment in [(3600,60),(86400,300)]:\n        served=np.asarray(simulate(asset,stamp,increment,length,1000,context)[2:])\n        expected=generate_variant(features(context,stamp,increment),asset,stamp,increment,length,1000,'lead:0.5')\n        np.testing.assert_allclose(served,expected,rtol=1e-12)\n        print(asset,length,'lead production/research match')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
