{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_293","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"cat agent/BUDGET.md; apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+## Iteration 32 — price-lattice projection on the hourly finalist (preregistered)\n+\n+- Hypothesis: projecting continuous fans onto a price grid inferred from observed quotes may improve calibration at the scored price precision. The earlier quantization experiment used a weaker hourly model and did not receive final reward confirmation.\n+- Change: preserve the exact-temporal/Sobol hourly forecast and compare two past-context grid estimators: minimum positive close difference, and a greatest-common-divisor lattice after controlled decimal conversion. Project only generated prices, never repair or round historical market data. Do not choose a new random seed or change volatility.\n+- Result: pending dense 1000-path official CRPS and rewards in both development windows.\n+- Verdict: require consistent gains and verify inferred-grid safety; otherwise retain continuous paths.\n+- Lesson: pending. A minimum observed price change is not automatically the exchange tick size, so the estimators are explicit hypotheses.\n+\n+### Iteration 31 result\n+\n+Context-only adaptive calibration does not pass the consistency gate. Quarter-strength gives COM_EQU CRPS ratios 1.00027/0.99849, hourly 1.00064/1.00012, and daily crypto 1.00002/0.99932; half strength increases regressions. Reject. The completed-volatility moment ratio is not a reliable replacement for the fixed conditional forecast.\n+\n+### Fine-grid calibration development result\n+\n+The 300-epoch fine-grid correction still fails across regimes: half strength gives COM_EQU 0.99864/1.00152, hourly 1.00003/0.99980, daily crypto 0.99968/1.00222. Full strength is worse in dev2. Reject this checkpoint. The independently preregistered 600-epoch run selects epoch 388 (pre-field objective 0.799594), with its development screen pending; no further extensions are planned.\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/research.py\n@@\n     output['tick']=float(positive_differences.min()) if len(positive_differences) else 0.\n+    digits = min(8,max(0,12-int(np.floor(np.log10(output['last'])))))\n+    factor = 10.**digits\n+    output['gcd_tick'] = 0.\n+    if len(close)>1 and close.max()*factor<np.iinfo(np.int64).max/4:\n+        integer_prices = np.rint(close.to_numpy()*factor).astype(np.int64)\n+        output['gcd_tick'] = float(np.gcd.reduce(np.abs(np.diff(integer_prices)))/factor)\n@@\n-    lead_strength=.5 if parts[0] in ['location','periodic','uncertainty','clock','sharp','adaptive','calibration','calibration600'] else float(parts[2]) if parts[0] in ['combined','combined_exact'] else float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='lead' else None\n-    sampler=parts[5] if parts[0]=='sharp' and len(parts)>5 else parts[3] if parts[0] in ['combined','combined_exact'] and len(parts)>3 else parts[1] if parts[0]=='sampler' else None\n+    lead_strength=.5 if parts[0] in ['location','periodic','uncertainty','clock','sharp','adaptive','calibration','calibration600','ticked'] else float(parts[2]) if parts[0] in ['combined','combined_exact'] else float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='lead' else None\n+    sampler='sobol' if parts[0]=='ticked' else parts[5] if parts[0]=='sharp' and len(parts)>5 else parts[3] if parts[0] in ['combined','combined_exact'] and len(parts)>3 else parts[1] if parts[0]=='sampler' else None\n@@\n-    temporal_strength=float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='sharp' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['temporal','temporal_exact','combined','combined_exact'] else None\n-    temporal_kind='temporal_exact' if parts[0] in ['temporal_exact','combined_exact','sharp'] else 'temporal'\n+    temporal_strength=1. if parts[0]=='ticked' else float(parts[2]) if parts[0]=='sharp' else float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['temporal','temporal_exact','combined','combined_exact'] else None\n+    temporal_kind='temporal_exact' if parts[0] in ['temporal_exact','combined_exact','sharp','ticked'] else 'temporal'\n@@\n-    atom_mode=parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n-    atom_parameter=float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n+    tick_kind=parts[1] if parts[0]=='ticked' else 'min'\n+    atom_mode='quantize' if parts[0]=='ticked' else parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n+    atom_parameter=1. if parts[0]=='ticked' else float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n@@\n-    if atom_mode=='quantize' and 0<feature['tick']<feature['last']*.01:\n-        tick=feature['tick']*atom_parameter\n+    tick = feature['gcd_tick'] if tick_kind=='gcd' else feature['tick']\n+    if atom_mode=='quantize' and 0<tick<feature['last']*.01:\n+        tick *= atom_parameter\n*** Update File: /workspace/agent/rank_screen.py\n@@\n-\\\"\\\"\\\"Sampled end-of-window official reward ranks; not a full emission replay.\\\"\\\"\\\"\n+\\\"\\\"\\\"Official reward replay from scored candidates, with optional round thinning.\\\"\\\"\\\"\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nwhile pgrep -f '\"'^/workspace/.venv/bin/python3 agent/research.py --name extended_calibration_screen '\"' >/dev/null; do sleep 5; done\nuv run agent/research.py --name ticked_hourly_dense --variants combined_exact:1:0.5:sobol,ticked:min,ticked:gcd --format high --paths 1000 --stride-high 1 --workers 6 > agent/ticked_hourly_dense.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
