ement confirmation and promotion\n+\n+The full-temporal/Sobol stack with a 30-minute, 0.75-strength crypto clock reaches daily-crypto reward ratios 0.218222/0.126951, ranks 62/163 out of 257. A 15-minute, full-strength COM_EQU clock reaches 0.014075/0.009365, ranks 129/216. Both improve the earlier lead-only daily model in both windows at 1000 paths and all reward rounds. The half-temporal crypto alternative gives 0.249621/0.099636: a marginally higher two-window mean, but a substantially weaker minimum-window result. Prefer the common full temporal strength for robustness and fewer competition-specific strength parameters; do not claim it maximizes the two-window arithmetic mean. Promote the full stack for both daily competitions. Together with the confirmed hourly model, development Score estimates are approximately 36.724 and 33.618.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nimport sys,time\nsys.path.insert(0,'agent')\nimport numpy as np,pandas as pd\nfrom modeling import simulate\nfrom predict import load_context\nfrom research import features,generate_variant\nstamp=pd.Timestamp('2026-08-10 12:34:37',tz='UTC')\nfor asset in ['BTC','HYPE','SP500','GOOGLX']:\n    context=load_context(asset,stamp-pd.Timedelta(days=7),stamp)\n    for length,increment in [(3600,60),(86400,300)]:\n        started=time.perf_counter()\n        actual=np.asarray(simulate(asset,stamp,increment,length,1000,context)[2:])\n        elapsed=time.perf_counter()-started\n        expected=generate_variant(features(context,stamp,increment),asset,stamp,increment,length,1000,'stacked')\n        np.testing.assert_allclose(actual,expected,rtol=1e-12)\n        future=context.copy()\n        future.loc[stamp+pd.Timedelta(minutes=1)]=1e8\n        np.testing.assert_array_equal(actual,np.asarray(simulate(asset,stamp,increment,length,1000,future)[2:]))\n        damaged=context.copy()\n        damaged.iloc[::7]=np.nan\n        small=np.asarray(simulate(asset,stamp,increment,length,17,damaged)[2:])\n        assert small.shape==(17,length//increment+1) and np.isfinite(small).all() and (small>0).all()\n        print(asset,length,'stacked match and contract checks',round(elapsed,4))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"BTC 3600 stacked match and contract checks 0.0463\nBTC 86400 stacked match and contract checks 0.0831\nHYPE 3600 stacked match and contract checks 0.0277\nHYPE 86400 stacked match and contract checks 0.0772\nSP500 3600 stacked match and contract checks 0.0275\nSP500 86400 stacked match and contract checks 0.0756\nGOOGLX 3600 stacked match and contract checks 0.0276\nGOOGLX 86400 stacked match and contract checks 0.077\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
