{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_322","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: agent/journal.md\n@@\n # Research journal — campaign-3\n+\n+## Iteration 34 — distribution and periodic interactions (preregistered)\n+\n+- Hypothesis: the stronger temporal/Sobol stack can change which finite-fan tail shape or discretization is calibrated, and a previously weak periodic residual may complement rather than duplicate the new temporal predictor.\n+- Change: hold the stack fixed and separately test daily GCD quote projection; Sobol Student degrees 3, 4 and 8 at unchanged RMS; and the existing periodic residual at half/full strengths. Preserve draws, train cutoffs and all clock/lead settings. No new field dates or miner paths are examined.\n+- Result: pending 1000-path official CRPS on both development windows; promising daily refresh also receives denser dev2 confirmation with its old-data control.\n+- Verdict: demand consistent gains before reward replay. Do not combine successful individual modifications without checking their interaction.\n+- Lesson: pending. This is a controlled interaction check, not permission for unbounded tail grids.\n*** Update File: agent/research.py\n@@\n-    stacked_mode = parts[0] in ['stacked','refresh','refresh_old']\n+    stacked_mode = parts[0] in ['stacked','refresh','refresh_old','stacktick','stackdf','stackperiodic']\n+    sampler_degrees = float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='stackdf' else 5.\n@@\n-    periodic_strength=float(parts[1]) if parts[0]=='periodic' else None\n+    periodic_strength=float(parts[1]) if parts[0] in ['periodic','stackperiodic'] else None\n@@\n-    tick_kind=parts[1] if parts[0]=='ticked' else 'min'\n-    atom_mode='quantize' if parts[0]=='ticked' else parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n-    atom_parameter=1. if parts[0]=='ticked' else float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n+    tick_kind=parts[1] if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else 'min'\n+    atom_mode='quantize' if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else parts[0] if parts[0] in ['symboot','hurdle','quantize'] else None\n+    atom_parameter=1. if parts[0] in ['ticked','stacktick'] else float(parts[1]) if atom_mode else 0.\n@@\n-        shocks = mixture_shocks(count, steps, draw_seed, sampler)\n+        shocks = mixture_shocks(count, steps, draw_seed, sampler, sampler_degrees)\n*** Update File: agent/sampling.py\n@@\n-def mixture_shocks(count, steps, seed, mode):\n+def mixture_shocks(count, steps, seed, mode, degrees=5.):\n@@\n-        scales = np.sqrt(3 / chi2.ppf(np.clip(uniforms[:, :1], 1e-12, 1 - 1e-12), 5))\n+        scales = np.sqrt((degrees - 2) / chi2.ppf(np.clip(uniforms[:, :1], 1e-12, 1 - 1e-12), degrees))\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nuv run agent/research.py --name stack_interactions --variants stacked,stacktick:gcd,stackdf:3,stackdf:4,stackdf:8,stackperiodic:0.5,stackperiodic:1 --format low --paths 1000 --workers 4 > agent/stack_interactions.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
